@prefix lgo:  <https://legalgraph.org/ontology#> .
@prefix lgv:  <https://legalgraph.org/vocab/> .
@prefix lg:  <https://legalgraph.org/id/> .
@prefix eli:  <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Latvia: Section 4 of the Information Society Services Law (additions to data/extracted/lv/).

lg:LV-ISSL
    eli:title "Information Society Services Law"@en ;
    lgo:shortName "ISSL" ;
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2000-31 ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://likumi.lv/ta/en/en/id/96619> ;
    rdfs:comment "4. pants merges the Directive's name, address and register items into a single point and adds nothing beyond the Directive's floor; (2) is the price-clarity clause."@en .

lg:LV-KL
    eli:title "Commercial Law"@en ;
    lgo:shortName "Komerclikums" ;
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2017-1132 ;
    eli:id_local "LV 5490" ;
    rdfs:comment "17. pants extends the merchant's business-document disclosures (firma, reģistrācijas numurs, juridiskā adrese, liquidation/insolvency status) verbatim to the merchant's website; (2) adds branch particulars. Consolidated text from likumi.lv."@en .

lg:LV-VVL
    lgo:shortName "VVL" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://likumi.lv/ta/id/14740-valsts-valodas-likums> ;
    rdfs:comment "21. pants requires public information in Latvian for public bodies and private entities performing public functions, Latvian on product labelling and manuals, translations for imported goods, Latvian in public notices touching legitimate public interests, and the Latvian text taking the primary place next to any foreign text."@en .

lg:LV-PTAL
    eli:transposes lg:EU-2013-11 ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://likumi.lv/ta/id/23309> ;
    rdfs:comment "19.1 pants is the trader ADR information duty: (1)-(2) the PTAC-listed dispute resolvers with website addresses on the trader's own site or in contract terms; (3) is the after-complaint analogue, triggered when the trader refuses the consumer's claim during the dispute."@en .

lg:LV-PRESI
    lgo:shortName "Preses likums" ;
    eli:id_local "LV 1991-01-28" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://likumi.lv/ta/id/64879-par-presi-un-citiem-masu-informacijas-lidzekliem> ;
    rdfs:comment "5.1 pants makes media-service providers publish the Article 6(1) European Media Freedom Act information easily and directly to service recipients — e.g. on their website, press publication or electronic media service. The older 18. pants imprint is tied to each press-publication issue (print data) and is not modelled as a website duty."@en .
